tt-local-generator (0.2.6) noble; urgency=medium

  * TT-TV artgen channels: fix empty pool — artgen MediaRecord objects are now
    included in the attractor record set so named playlists containing artgen
    items (Palettes, Landscapes, etc.) actually populate and play.
  * TT-TV expert rendering: artgen artifacts are now rendered by content type.
    SVG files → Gtk.Picture (full vector quality).  Palette JSON → full-screen
    color swatch strip (_ColorSwatchArea, cairo) with the palette name and lore
    text.  Verse/freeform/ANSI text → large centered italic text on dark canvas.
    Unknown types fall back to thumbnail PNG.
  * TT-TV channel switch: named-playlist and "All Videos" channels now fetch a
    fresh record set from the store on every switch, so records added after
    TT-TV opened (and artgen records not in the initial pool) are included.
  * playlist_store: _to_pl now materialises record_ids for live/filter playlists
    (artgen auto-playlists such as Landscapes, Palettes, etc.) so TT-TV channel
    switching can match records by ID regardless of playlist type.

